      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I can sense the emotional exhaustion and desperation in your words. Feeling like a mere cog in a machine can be suffocating, but remember that you're more than your job. Your existence and worth aren't defined by your hours worked or what you do, you have a life outside of work. Take a step back, prioritize your well-being, and explore what brings you joy and meaning.",
      "source": "target",
